usage: research_tool [-h] [--base BASE]
                     {create,benchmarking,comparisons,conclusions,errata,execution-notes,ideas,prompts,benchmark,execution,conclude,idea,validate,link,locate-python} ...

Manage DIL research artifacts

positional arguments:
  {create,benchmarking,comparisons,conclusions,errata,execution-notes,ideas,prompts,benchmark,execution,conclude,idea,validate,link,locate-python}
    create              Create a research artifact
    benchmarking        Create a benchmark artifact
    comparisons         Create a comparison artifact
    conclusions         Create a conclusion artifact
    errata              Create a correction artifact
    execution-notes     Create a execution artifact
    ideas               Create a idea artifact
    prompts             Create a prompt artifact
    benchmark           Create a benchmarking artifact
    execution           Create a execution-notes artifact
    conclude            Create a conclusions artifact
    idea                Create a ideas artifact
    validate            Validate a research artifact
    link                Add related artifacts to an existing artifact
    locate-python       Print the newest available Python binary path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base BASE           DIL base path
